# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                 InfiChat — .gitignore                                       ║
# ║  Deny-by-default. Everything is hidden unless explicitly re-included.       ║
# ║                                                                             ║
# ║  Structure                                                                  ║
# ║    §1  Proprietary source code & IP                                         ║
# ║    §2  Secrets, keys & environment files                                    ║
# ║    §3  Database files, schemas & migration scripts                          ║
# ║    §4  Proprietary documentation & research                                 ║
# ║    §5  Test suites & test artifacts                                         ║
# ║    §6  Proprietary brand assets                                             ║
# ║    §7  Dependencies & virtual environments                                  ║
# ║    §8  Build output & compiled artifacts                                    ║
# ║    §9  Data volumes & persistent storage                                    ║
# ║    §10 Logs & debug output                                                  ║
# ║    §11 IDE, editor & OS artifacts                                           ║
# ║    §12 Agent / assistant scratch files                                      ║
# ║    §13 Archives, dumps & backups                                            ║
# ║    §14 Runtime & container state                                            ║
# ║    §15 Credential material (deep patterns)                                  ║
# ║    §16 Tooling cache & incremental state                                    ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝


